{"title": "Lenore De Hurst", "pageid": 16270, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lenore_De_Hurst", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Characters", "Authors", "Divinity references"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Lenore De Hurst</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Lenore De Hurst.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png/300px-Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png/300px-Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png.webp 1x, /w/images/6/6a/Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Lenore De Hurst.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"identity\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Identity</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"faction\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Faction</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\">Mystra</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"family\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Family</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yrre\" title=\"Yrre\">Yrre</a> (partner)</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hometown\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hometown</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Tower\" title=\"Arcane Tower\">Arcane Tower</a></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"class\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Class</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\n<b>Lenore De Hurst</b><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">cleric</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra\" title=\"Mystra\">Mystra</a> who lived in the <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Tower\" title=\"Arcane Tower\">Arcane Tower</a>, where she researched the magical properties of the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/Help_Omeluum_Investigate_the_Parasite\" title=\"Help Omeluum Investigate the Parasite\">Help Omeluum Investigate the Parasite</a>        </div>\n<p>Although Lenore is not encountered in any playthrough, her former home can be visited, and she is referenced by several different characters, books, and item descriptions. The party can also find correspondence she kept with other magic practitioners, including <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/38px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/50px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lorroakan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Yrre\" title=\"Yrre\">Yrre</a>.\n</p><p>In order to help Omeluum investigate the player character's mind flayer parasite, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blurg\" title=\"Blurg\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/25px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/38px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/50px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blurg\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png/25px-Portrait_Blurg.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Portrait_Blurg.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blurg\" title=\"Blurg\">Blurg</a> directs them to Lenore's tower. Lenore grew several rare and dangerous species of fungi that are needed to learn more about the parasite. On the first and basement floors of the Arcane Tower, the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tongue_of_Madness\" title=\"Tongue of Madness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/20px-Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/30px-Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/40px-Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/20px-Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tongue_of_Madness\" title=\"Tongue of Madness\">Tongue of Madness</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(ingredient)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (ingredient)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/30px-Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/40px-Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png/20px-Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Timmask_Spores_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(ingredient)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (ingredient)\">Timmask Spores</a> can be found.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Lenore is a cleric of Mystra who was studying the magical properties of the Underdark.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Lenore and her partner, the gnomish inventor Yrre, lived and worked together for a short time in the Arcane Tower.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> After a falling out, Yrre left the Underdark to pursue their obsession with storm magic,<sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> leaving Lenore alone with her research. Lenore remained in the tower, which moved around the Underdark,<sup id=\"cite_ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> with only her pet dog Myrna and her construct <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/25px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/38px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/50px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bernard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/25px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\">Bernard</a> for company.\n</p><p>At some point during her stay in the Underdark, Myrna died and was buried in the Dread Hollow. Her grave overlooks the lake and contains her favourite autumncrocus flowers. Lenore later became enamoured with a <a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\">bulette</a> she found near Myrna's grave, taming it to become a guardian.<sup id=\"cite_ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Lenore was fond of gardening<sup id=\"cite_ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and was particularly interested in the antimagic properties of sussur tree bark and flowers.<sup id=\"cite_ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> She used them to control the lighting and turrets in the tower. Lenore also created the tower guardian Bernard, a construct that only responds to poetry and play scripts. She programmed Bernard to remind her that she was loved; however, she grew lonely with no one else for company.\n</p><p>In 1481 DR, Lenore had just begun writing her treatise on sussur flowers when she was called to <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> to confer with her fellow Mystran clerics.<sup id=\"cite_ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Before departing the tower, Lenore left a message for Yrre, asking that they await her return with the hope that the two could reunite.<sup id=\"cite_ref-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Lenore planned to depart the tower only for a short time. However, she never returned, and her research and tower were untouched for a decade. Yrre eventually visited with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Spellsparkler\" title=\"The Spellsparkler\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Spellsparkler\" title=\"The Spellsparkler\">The Spellsparkler</a>, a staff they made specially for Lenore,<sup id=\"cite_ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and Lenore's letter. They waited in vain, but eventually left when she failed to return.\n</p><p>Lenore's last known location was her conference in Baldur's Gate, where she was temporarily ensnared by an anomaly caused by <a href=\"/wiki/Tarquin\" title=\"Tarquin\">Tarquin</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_equipment\">Related equipment</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Light\" title=\"Guiding Light\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Light\" title=\"Guiding Light\">Guiding Light</a></span><sup id=\"cite_ref-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\">Staff of Arcane Blessing</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Blast_Pendant\" title=\"The Blast Pendant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/The_Blast_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Blast_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/48/The_Blast_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Blast_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/48/The_Blast_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Blast_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/The_Blast_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Blast_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/The_Blast_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Blast_Pendant\" title=\"The Blast Pendant\">The Blast Pendant</a></span><sup id=\"cite_ref-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Sparkswall\" title=\"The Sparkswall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/The_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Sparkswall\" title=\"The Sparkswall\">The Sparkswall</a></span><sup id=\"cite_ref-14\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Spellsparkler\" title=\"The Spellsparkler\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/The_Spellsparkler_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Spellsparkler\" title=\"The Spellsparkler\">The Spellsparkler</a></span><sup id=\"cite_ref-15\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r347748\"><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Query_from_DeHurst\" title=\"A Query from DeHurst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Book_Parchment_P_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_Query_from_DeHurst\" title=\"A Query from DeHurst\">A Query from DeHurst</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/De_Hurst%27s_Diary\" title=\"De Hurst's Diary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/De_Hurst%27s_Diary\" title=\"De Hurst's Diary\">De Hurst's Diary<